{"seq":2,"slug":"code-splitting-strategies","title":"代码分割策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-bundler-internals/optimization/code-splitting-strategies","wordCount":1045,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码分割策略\">代码分割策略</h1><p>代码分割（Code Splitting）的核心问题是：如何把一张模块依赖图切割成若干个 chunk，使得首屏加载量最小、运行时按需加载最优、浏览器缓存命中率最高。这是一个多目标优化问题——chunk 太多导致 HTTP 请求瀑布流，chunk 太少导致首屏加载冗余代码。2026 年的 Rust 打包器在算法层面提供了比 webpack 5 更精细的控制手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-chunk-与-chunk-group\">核心概念：Chunk 与 Chunk Group</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    Entry[入口 chunk: main]&#10;    Async1[异步 chunk: page-dashboard]&#10;    Async2[异步 chunk: page-settings]&#10;    Common[公共 chunk: vendor-react]&#10;&#10;    Entry --&gt;|同步加载| Common&#10;    Entry --&gt;|动态 import| Async1&#10;    Entry --&gt;|动态 import| Async2&#10;    Async1 --&gt;|同步依赖| Common&#10;    Async2 --&gt;|同步依赖| Common\">flowchart TB\n    Entry[入口 chunk: main]\n    Async1[异步 chunk: page-dashboard]\n    Async2[异步 chunk: page-settings]\n    Common[公共 chunk: vendor-react]\n\n    Entry --&gt;|同步加载| Common\n    Entry --&gt;|动态 import| Async1\n    Entry --&gt;|动态 import| Async2\n    Async1 --&gt;|同步依赖| Common\n    Async2 --&gt;|同步依赖| Common</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>产物形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Chunk</td>\n<td>一组将被打包到同一个文件的模块集合</td>\n<td>一个 <code>.js</code> 文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chunk Group</td>\n<td>满足某个加载场景所需的所有 chunk 的集合</td>\n<td>运行时并行加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Entry Chunk</td>\n<td>包含运行时引导代码的入口 chunk</td>\n<td><code>&lt;script&gt;</code> 直接引入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Async Chunk</td>\n<td>由 <code>import()</code> 触发按需加载的 chunk</td>\n<td>运行时动态请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Common Chunk</td>\n<td>被多个 chunk 共享的公共代码提取结果</td>\n<td>并行预加载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分割触发点-三种来源\">分割触发点：三种来源</h2><p><strong>1. 入口分割</strong>：多入口配置（<code>entry: { app: &#39;./app.ts&#39;, admin: &#39;./admin.ts&#39; }</code>）产生独立的入口 chunk。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 动态导入分割</strong>：<code>import(&#39;./page&#39;)</code> 表达式自动创建异步分割点。打包器从该模块出发，收集其可达且未被同步引用的模块集合，形成独立 chunk。</p>\n<p><strong>3. splitChunks 优化分割</strong>：通过启发式规则将公共模块提取为共享 chunk——减少重复代码、提高缓存命中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"splitchunks-算法-webpack-rspack-的启发式\">splitChunks 算法：webpack/Rspack 的启发式</h2><p>Rspack 继承了 webpack 5 的 <code>optimization.splitChunks</code> 配置，其核心是一组**缓存组（cacheGroup）**规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"optimization: {&#10;  splitChunks: {&#10;    chunks: &#39;all&#39;,&#10;    minSize: 20000,        // chunk 最小字节&#10;    maxSize: 250000,       // chunk 最大字节（超出则尝试进一步拆分）&#10;    minChunks: 2,          // 被引用次数阈值&#10;    cacheGroups: {&#10;      vendor: {&#10;        test: /[\\\\/]node_modules[\\\\/]/,&#10;        priority: -10,&#10;        reuseExistingChunk: true,&#10;      },&#10;      common: {&#10;        minChunks: 2,&#10;        priority: -20,&#10;        reuseExistingChunk: true,&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">optimization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  splitChunks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    chunks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'all'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    minSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// chunk 最小字节</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    maxSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">250000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// chunk 最大字节（超出则尝试进一步拆分）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    minChunks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 被引用次数阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    cacheGroups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      vendor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">/]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">node_modules</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\\\</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">/]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        reuseExistingChunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      common</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        minChunks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        reuseExistingChunk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>算法执行流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>遍历所有模块，按 cacheGroup 规则分组</li>\n<li>对每个组，检查是否满足 <code>minSize</code>、<code>minChunks</code> 等阈值</li>\n<li>满足条件的模块集合形成新的 common chunk</li>\n<li>如果 common chunk 超过 <code>maxSize</code>，尝试按模块边界进一步拆分</li>\n<li>更新各 chunk 的依赖关系，确保运行时加载顺序正确</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 分割前&#10;        A[Page A: 200KB]&#10;        B[Page B: 180KB]&#10;        Shared[react+lodash: 150KB 被 A/B 共享]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 分割后&#10;        A2[Page A: 50KB]&#10;        B2[Page B: 30KB]&#10;        V[vendor chunk: 150KB]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; Shared&#10;    B --&gt; Shared&#10;    A2 --&gt; V&#10;    B2 --&gt; V\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 分割前\n        A[Page A: 200KB]\n        B[Page B: 180KB]\n        Shared[react+lodash: 150KB 被 A/B 共享]\n    end\n    subgraph 分割后\n        A2[Page A: 50KB]\n        B2[Page B: 30KB]\n        V[vendor chunk: 150KB]\n    end\n    A --&gt; Shared\n    B --&gt; Shared\n    A2 --&gt; V\n    B2 --&gt; V</pre><h2 id=\"rolldown-的-advancedchunks-声明式精细控制\">Rolldown 的 advancedChunks：声明式精细控制</h2><p>Rolldown 1.0 在 Rollup 的 <code>manualChunks</code> 基础上引入了 <code>advancedChunks</code> API，支持更灵活的声明式规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// rolldown.config.js&#10;export default {&#10;  output: {&#10;    advancedChunks: {&#10;      groups: [&#10;        {&#10;          name: &#39;vendor&#39;,&#10;          test: /node_modules/,&#10;          minSize: 10000,&#10;          maxSize: 500000,&#10;        },&#10;        {&#10;          name: &#39;common&#39;,&#10;          minReferenceCount: 3,&#10;          minSize: 5000,&#10;        },&#10;      ],&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// rolldown.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  output: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    advancedChunks: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      groups: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'vendor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          test:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">node_modules</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          minSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          maxSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'common'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          minReferenceCount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          minSize: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>与 webpack 的 splitChunks 相比，advancedChunks 的优势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>webpack splitChunks</th>\n<th>Rolldown advancedChunks</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则数量</td>\n<td>多层嵌套，复杂</td>\n<td>扁平 groups 数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大小控制</td>\n<td>minSize/maxSize</td>\n<td>支持 + 按依赖图距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用计数</td>\n<td>minChunks</td>\n<td>minReferenceCount + 权重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试</td>\n<td>需要 stats 分析</td>\n<td>内置可视化输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>JS 执行（慢）</td>\n<td>Rust 执行（快）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"turbopack-的-chunk-策略\">Turbopack 的 Chunk 策略</h2><p>Turbopack 在开发模式采用不同的分割哲学：<strong>尽量少的 chunk 数量</strong>。因为开发时不需要生产级的缓存优化，更少的 chunk 意味着更少的运行时加载协调开销。</p>\n<p>Turbopack 的分割规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个路由入口一个 chunk（对应 Next.js 的路由）</li>\n<li>动态 import 产生异步 chunk</li>\n<li>不做 vendor 提取（开发时不必要）</li>\n<li>生产构建时启用更激进的分割（接近 webpack 的策略）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"分割粒度与-http-2-的关系\">分割粒度与 HTTP/2 的关系</h2><p>在 HTTP/1.1 时代，chunk 过多意味着并发连接耗尽，因此倾向于合并大 chunk。HTTP/2 的多路复用改变了这个权衡——可以并行传输数百个小 chunk 而不占额外连接。</p>\n<p>但 HTTP/2 仍有实际限制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个 chunk 有固定的头部开销（~30-50 bytes）</li>\n<li>浏览器的并发 H2 流有上限（Chrome: 256）</li>\n<li>太小的 chunk 让 gzip/brotli 压缩率下降（压缩需要上下文）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>经验法则：生产环境中，单个 chunk 控制在 20KB-250KB（gzip 后 5KB-80KB）是 HTTP/2 下的甜区。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态导入的-tree-shaking\">动态导入的 Tree Shaking</h2><p>Turbopack（Next.js 16.2）和 Rolldown 都支持对动态 import 的解构进行 Tree Shaking：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const { cat } = await import(&#39;./animals&#39;);&#10;// 等效于静态 import { cat } from &#39;./animals&#39;&#10;// animals.ts 中未被引用的 dog, bird 可以被裁剪\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./animals'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等效于静态 import { cat } from './animals'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// animals.ts 中未被引用的 dog, bird 可以被裁剪</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这打破了传统的假设——动态 import 不再是「全量加载目标模块」的黑箱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代码分割是多目标优化：首屏大小、按需加载延迟、缓存命中率</li>\n<li>splitChunks（Rspack）通过缓存组规则启发式提取公共模块</li>\n<li>advancedChunks（Rolldown）提供更简洁的声明式分割控制</li>\n<li>HTTP/2 改变了最优 chunk 粒度——20-250KB 是当前甜区</li>\n<li>动态 import 的解构模式现在也支持 Tree Shaking</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"tree-shaking-deep\">Tree Shaking 深度机制</a> — Tree Shaking 结果如何影响可分割边界</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../build-tooling-bundlers/optimization/code-splitting\">代码分割基础</a> — 用户层视角的分割配置</li>\n<li><a href=\"persistent-caching\">持久化缓存与增量构建</a> — 分割粒度如何影响缓存命中</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码分割策略","id":"代码分割策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：Chunk 与 Chunk Group","id":"核心概念-chunk-与-chunk-group"},{"level":2,"text":"分割触发点：三种来源","id":"分割触发点-三种来源"},{"level":2,"text":"splitChunks 算法：webpack/Rspack 的启发式","id":"splitchunks-算法-webpack-rspack-的启发式"},{"level":2,"text":"Rolldown 的 advancedChunks：声明式精细控制","id":"rolldown-的-advancedchunks-声明式精细控制"},{"level":2,"text":"Turbopack 的 Chunk 策略","id":"turbopack-的-chunk-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"分割粒度与 HTTP/2 的关系","id":"分割粒度与-http-2-的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"动态导入的 Tree Shaking","id":"动态导入的-tree-shaking"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Tree Shaking 深度机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-bundler-internals/optimization/tree-shaking-deep"},"next":{"title":"持久化缓存与增量构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-bundler-internals/optimization/persistent-caching"}}